:"diuresis","polarity":"action"},{"start":466,"end":475,"concept_id":"poisoning","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"gloss":{"dsc:4.132":{"413":"purges downwards (κατὰ κοιλίαν)","431":"moves the urine","466":"protective against poisons (ἀλεξιφάρμακον)"}},"images":[]}